{
  "provider": "STUBA",
  "providerHotelId": "143582",
  "name": "Tulip Creek Hotel Apartments",
  "starRating": 4,
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "Information about the surrounding area",
      "text": "Located in Dubai (Deira), Tulip Creek Hotel Apartments is steps from City Centre Deira and a 3-minute drive from Dubai Creek.  This aparthotel is 4.4 mi (7.1 km) from Gold Souk and 5.1 mi (8.2 km) from Dubai World Trade Centre."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "Details of room types available",
      "text": "Make yourself at home in one of the 90 air-conditioned rooms featuring kitchenettes with refrigerators and microwaves. Complimentary wireless internet access keeps you connected, and cable programming is available for your entertainment. Conveniences include phones, as well as safes and desks."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "Information about the hotel property",
      "text": "Take advantage of recreation opportunities including a health club and an outdoor pool. This aparthotel also features complimentary wireless internet access, concierge services, and a banquet hall. Getting to the surf and sand is a breeze with the complimentary beach shuttle."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "Activities available near the hotel",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003ECity Centre Deira - 0.1 km / 0.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Deira Clocktower - 0.8 km / 0.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Creek Park - 1 km / 0.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Dubai Tennis Stadium - 2.1 km / 1.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Al Ghurair Centre - 2.4 km / 1.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Al Nasr Leisureland - 2.4 km / 1.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Reef Mall - 2.5 km / 1.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Fish Roundabout - 2.9 km / 1.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Deira Twin Towers Shopping Centre - 3.1 km / 1.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Mohammed Bin Rashid University Of Medicine and Health Sciences - 3.1 km / 1.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E American Hospital Dubai - 3.4 km / 2.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Dubai Creek Golf \u0026 Yacht Club - 3.6 km / 2.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Al Seef - 3.6 km / 2.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Wafi City Mall - 3.7 km / 2.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Naif Souq - 3.9 km / 2.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003EDubai Intl. Airport (DXB) - 5 km / 3.1 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Sharjah (SHJ-Sharjah Intl.) - 29.2 km / 18.1 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Al Maktoum Intl. Airport (DWC) - 66.6 km / 41.4 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe preferred airport for Tulip Creek Hotel Apartments is Dubai Intl. Airport (DXB). \u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "Hotel policies and disclaimer",
      "text": "\u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EExtra-person charges may apply and vary depending on property policy\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGovernment-issued photo identification and a credit card, debit card, or cash deposit may be required at check-in for incidental charges\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpecial requests are subject to availability upon check-in and may incur additional charges; special requests cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property accepts credit cards, debit cards, and cash\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHost has not indicated whether there is a carbon monoxide detector on the property; consider bringing a portable detector with you on the trip\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EHost has indicated there is a smoke detector on the property\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafety features at this property include a fire extinguisher, a security system, and a first aid kit\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property is professionally cleaned\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPlease note that cultural norms and guest policies may differ by country and by property; the policies listed are provided by the property\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003ELocal laws may restrict unmarried guests from sharing rooms. Guests are responsible for providing proof of marriage, if requested by the property. \u003C/li\u003E \u003Cli\u003EPool access available from 9 AM to 6 PM.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOnly registered guests are allowed in the guestrooms. \u003C/li\u003E \u003Cli\u003ENo pets and no service animals are allowed at this property. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EFree in-room WiFi has a 1-device limit. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe property is professionally cleaned.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EContactless check-out is available.\u003C/li\u003E \u003C/ul\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "Meals and restaurants at the hotel",
      "text": "Enjoy a meal at Tulip Cafe or snacks in the coffee shop/cafe. The aparthotel also offers room service (during limited hours). Continental breakfasts are available daily from 6:30 AM to 10:30 AM for a fee."
    },
